{"id":"vod_sn_37937","vodId":"37937","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"吸血鬼同盟","name_cn":"吸血鬼同盟","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/ae6a422b974b9a4711deb73d4d897825.jpg"},"summary":"电视动画《吸血鬼同盟》改编自日本漫画家环望原作的同名漫画。于2010年1月7日起在AT-X首播，全12话。一直过着普通高中生生活的镝木晃，年幼时曾经与人缔结了一个盟约，那就是要侍奉君临黑暗世界的吸血鬼女王。在晃17岁生日的那天，吸血鬼女王米娜・柴佩西出现在他面前。她说她来日本的目的是要在日本建立一个吸血鬼专用居住区——吸血鬼特区（Vampire Bund）。知道吸血鬼存在的事实后人类社会动荡不安。米娜与晃之间偶尔会产生误解与分歧却又能相互理解，心与心的距离在逐渐缩短。但是忌讳吸血鬼存在的人类社会、谋求权利的同族、米娜婚约者的吸血鬼王家三大公的阴谋，各种各样的试炼在等待着他们……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:56:52","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/j2fj0A72fh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QsPNrVUh7x1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZJrV3ycY0h1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nXnCbe1T7H1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/J6y5r4Q2Pv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sQJLRjby1q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/g3bR9A93W21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/L9CiiPd4iB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/A7KXgHHaDE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xM0vdZs1TN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XuTEstX1Ac1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/U0rS05b8gb1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:04.744Z"}